## Model card

- **Name:** DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017
- **Short description:** DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 is described in local metadata as an updated checkpoint served behind DeepSeek’s flash route (successor to retired v4-flash routes), with large context and multimodal input.
- **Provider / access:** DeepSeek API (`deepseek-flash` now served by DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017 per DeepSeek API docs). Local metadata lists `opencode/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Checkpoint date implied by name (2026-10-17) but not independently verified from a dedicated official release note in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not stated in reviewed sources.
- **IDs:** `deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017`, `deepseek-flash` (current serving model per DeepSeek API docs).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 total; 384,000 max output (local metadata). Not independently verified from a dedicated official model spec page in this pass.
- **Modalities:** Text, image input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.30/$1.20 per 1M peak, $0.15/$0.60 off-peak for hosted deepseek-flash per local metadata; not independently verified from accessible official pricing page in this pass.
- **Architecture:** 552B/16B-active CED MoE per local metadata (MIT license noted in metadata description); not independently verified in this pass.

